usage: check_typed_kernel_typing.py [-h] [--repo REPO] --out OUT

Compile one positive and three deliberately ill-typed expressions with real
Lean. These are typing refusals, not executed financial counterexamples. Exit
0 means all four expected outcomes were observed; 1 means a negative term was
accepted; 3 means evidence was unavailable or failed for another reason.

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --out OUT
